  "instance_name": "life_vest_functionality",
  "label": "Purpose of a life vest",
  "description": "A life vest is a safety device designed to keep a person afloat in water, especially in situations where swimming ability is uncertain or compromised. The meme's implication that a life vest is 'unnecessary' because 'ice cubes float' is a logical fallacy, relying on the viewer's understanding of the actual purpose and necessity of life vests.",
